  "dog_life": "AWBI guidelines (26 Feb 2025) endorsed by Maharashtra's Cooperative Department: housing societies cannot ban pets, bar them from lifts or gardens, or charge pet fees - but in practice landlords and societies push back hard on a 'pit bull'. Dense city, few parks, heat and monsoon, heavy street-dog population; walks are early-morning affairs. No dog tax or mandatory insurance.",
